{"text":"kuruntokai","n":142,"lines":["சுனைப்பூக் குற்றுத் தொடலை தைஇப்","புனக்கிளி கடியும் பூங்கட் பேதை","தானறிந் தனளோ இலளோ பானாட்","பள்ளி யானையி னுயிர்த்தென்","உள்ளம் பின்னுந் தன்னுழை யதுவே"],"tr":["cuṉaippūk kuṟṟut toṭalai taiip","puṉakkiḷi kaṭiyum pūṅkaṭ pētai","tāṉaṟin taṉaḷō ilaḷō pāṉāṭ","paḷḷi yāṉaiyi ṉuyirtteṉ","uḷḷam piṉṉun taṉṉuḻai yatuvē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 14, veṇṭaḷai 3, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"சுனைப்பூக்","tr":"cuṉaippūk","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சுனைப்","tr":"cuṉaip"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூக்","tr":"pūk"}]},{"text":"குற்றுத்","tr":"kuṟṟut","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குற்","tr":"kuṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றுத்","tr":"ṟut"}]},{"text":"தொடலை","tr":"toṭalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொட","tr":"toṭa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"தைஇப்","tr":"taiip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"இப்","tr":"ip"}]}],[{"text":"புனக்கிளி","tr":"puṉakkiḷi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புனக்","tr":"puṉak"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிளி","tr":"kiḷi"}]},{"text":"கடியும்","tr":"kaṭiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடி","tr":"kaṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"பூங்கட்","tr":"pūṅkaṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூங்","tr":"pūṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கட்","tr":"kaṭ"}]},{"text":"பேதை","tr":"pētai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]}],[{"text":"தானறிந்","tr":"tāṉaṟin","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னறிந்","tr":"ṉaṟin"}]},{"text":"தனளோ","tr":"taṉaḷō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளோ","tr":"ḷō"}]},{"text":"இலளோ","tr":"ilaḷō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இல","tr":"ila"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளோ","tr":"ḷō"}]},{"text":"பானாட்","tr":"pāṉāṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாட்","tr":"ṉāṭ"}]}],[{"text":"பள்ளி","tr":"paḷḷi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பள்","tr":"paḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளி","tr":"ḷi"}]},{"text":"யானையி","tr":"yāṉaiyi","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யி","tr":"yi"}]},{"text":"னுயிர்த்தென்","tr":"ṉuyirtteṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"னுயிர்த்","tr":"ṉuyirt"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தென்","tr":"teṉ"}]}],[{"text":"உள்ளம்","tr":"uḷḷam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"உள்","tr":"uḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளம்","tr":"ḷam"}]},{"text":"பின்னுந்","tr":"piṉṉun","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னுந்","tr":"ṉun"}]},{"text":"தன்னுழை","tr":"taṉṉuḻai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னுழை","tr":"ṉuḻai"}]},{"text":"யதுவே","tr":"yatuvē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யது","tr":"yatu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"சுனைப்பூ","parts":[{"text":"சுனை","lemma":"cuṉai","gloss":"mountain pool"},{"text":"பூ","lemma":"pū","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"mountain pool flower"},{"surface":"குற்று","parts":[{"text":"குற்று","lemma":"kuṟu","gloss":"having plucked"}],"gloss":"having plucked"},{"surface":"தொடலை","parts":[{"text":"தொடலை","lemma":"toṭalai","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"தைஇ","parts":[{"text":"தைஇ","lemma":"tai","gloss":"having strung"}],"gloss":"having strung"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புனக்கிளி","parts":[{"text":"புனக்கிளி","lemma":"புனக்கிளி","gloss":"field parrots"}],"gloss":"field parrots","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கடியும்","parts":[{"text":"கடியும்","lemma":"kaṭi","gloss":"chasing away"}],"gloss":"chasing away"},{"surface":"பூங்கண்","parts":[{"text":"பூங்கண்","lemma":"பூங்கண்","gloss":"flower-like eyes"}],"gloss":"flower-like eyes","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பேதை","parts":[{"text":"பேதை","lemma":"pētai","gloss":"innocent girl"}],"gloss":"innocent girl"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"tāṉ","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"she"},{"surface":"அறிந்தனளோ","parts":[{"text":"அறிந்தனளோ","lemma":"அறிந்தனளோ","gloss":"did she know?"}],"gloss":"did she know?","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இலளோ","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"aḷ","gloss":"she"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"or did she not?"},{"surface":"பானாள்","parts":[{"text":"பானாள்","lemma":"பானாள்","gloss":"midnight"}],"gloss":"midnight","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பள்ளி","parts":[{"text":"பள்ளி","lemma":"paḷḷi","gloss":"resting"}],"gloss":"resting"},{"surface":"யானையின்","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like an elephant"},{"surface":"உயிர்த்து","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்த்து","lemma":"uyirttu","gloss":"having sighed"}],"gloss":"having sighed"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உள்ளம்","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளம்","lemma":"uḷḷam","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"பின்னும்","parts":[{"text":"பின்னும்","lemma":"piṉṉum","gloss":"still"}],"gloss":"still"},{"surface":"தன்னுழையதுவே","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"taṉ","gloss":"her"},{"text":"உழை","lemma":"uḻai","gloss":"vicinity"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"atu","gloss":"it"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is with her indeed"}]}],"literal":"Plucking mountain pool flowers, weaving a garland, / the innocent girl with flower-like eyes who chases parrots from the field, / does she know or does she not? At midnight, / sighing like a sleeping elephant, my / heart is still with her.","translation":"Plucking flowers from the mountain pool and weaving them into a garland, the innocent girl with flower-like eyes chases parrots from the millet field. Does she know of my state or not? At midnight, sighing deeply like a sleeping elephant, my heart still remains with her.","modern":"சுனைப் பூக்களைப் பறித்து, மாலை தொடுத்து, தினைப்புனத்துக் கிளிகளை விரட்டும் மலர் போன்ற கண்களை உடைய அந்தப் பேதைப்பெண், என் நிலையை அறிந்துள்ளாளா அல்லது அறியவில்லையா? நள்ளிரவில், படுத்திருக்கும் யானையைப் போலப் பெருமூச்சு விட்டுக்கொண்டு, என் நெஞ்சம் மீண்டும் அவளிடமே தங்கியிருக்கிறது.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the hero to himself after meeting the heroine in the mountain fields. He is back at his own place, but he is unable to sleep due to his intense love. He wonders if the innocent girl, who spends her days plucking pool flowers and chasing parrots, is aware of the effect she has had on him. The setting belongs to the Kuriñci tiṇai, which represents the union of lovers and the sweet anxiety of early love. The comparison of the hero's heavy midnight sighs to the deep breathing of a sleeping elephant beautifully conveys his profound longing and restlessness. Key words like 'pētai' (innocent girl) and 'paḷḷi yāṉai' (sleeping elephant) anchor the emotional and physical landscape of the poem.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.58],[0.58,1.05],[1.05,1.4],[1.4,1.75],[1.9,2.4],[2.4,2.7],[2.7,3.26],[3.38,3.6],[3.6,4.74],[4.74,4.9],[4.9,6.28],[6.28,7.66],[7.66,9.04],[9.04,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.7],[10.7,11.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.44],[0.44,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.82],[1.95,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.4,3.6],[3.6,4.36],[4.36,4.92],[4.92,5.49],[5.49,6.11],[6.11,6.32],[6.32,6.53],[6.53,6.95],[6.95,7.23],[7.23,7.51],[7.51,7.79],[7.79,8.0]]},"sync":[[["சுனைப்பூ","mountain pool flower"],["குற்று","having plucked"]],[["குற்று","having plucked"]],[["தொடலை","garland"]],[["தைஇ","having strung"]],[["புனக்கிளி","field parrots"]],[["கடியும்","chasing away"]],[["பூங்கண்","flower-like eyes"]],[["பேதை","innocent girl"]],[["தான்","she"],["அறிந்தனளோ","did she know?"]],[["அறிந்தனளோ","did she know?"]],[["இலளோ","or did she not?"]],[["பானாள்","midnight"]],[["பள்ளி","resting"]],[["யானையின்","like an elephant"]],[["யானையின்","like an elephant"],["உயிர்த்து","having sighed"],["என்","my"]],[["உள்ளம்","heart"]],[["பின்னும்","still"]],[["தன்னுழையதுவே","is with her indeed"]],[["தன்னுழையதுவே","is with her indeed"]]]}